{"id":"H3936","lemma":"לַעְדָּן","transliteration":"ladan","sayIt":"la-DAN","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ladan","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exo.6.17;\nson of: Gershon (H1648);\nbrother of: Shimei (H8096G);\nfather of: Jehieli= Jehiel (H3171H), Zetham (H2241), Joel (H3100O); also called Jahath at 1Ch.6.43; Libni;\n§ Laadan = \"put in order\"\n1) an Ephraimite ancestor of Joshua, son of Nun\n2) a Levite son of Gershom; also 'Libni'","glosses":["ladan"],"count":5,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ladan","kjv":"Laadan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ladan","kjv":"Laadan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ladan","kjv":"of Laadan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ladan","kjv":"of Laadan"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ladan","kjv":"of Laadan"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:26","note":"Ladan his son, Ammihud his son, Elishama his son,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H8096","lemma":"שִׁמְעִי","transliteration":"shimi","gloss":"Shimei"},{"id":"H1648","lemma":"גֵּרְשׁוֹן","transliteration":"gereshon","gloss":"Gershon"},{"id":"H3845","lemma":"לִבְנִי","transliteration":"livni","gloss":"Libni"},{"id":"H3189","lemma":"יַ֫חַת","transliteration":"yachat","gloss":"Jahath"},{"id":"H3171","lemma":"יְחִיאֵל","transliteration":"yechiel","gloss":"Jehiel"},{"id":"H2241","lemma":"זֵתָם","transliteration":"zetam","gloss":"Zetham"},{"id":"H3100","lemma":"יוֹאֵל","transliteration":"yoel","gloss":"Joel"},{"id":"H5989","lemma":"עַמִּיהוּד","transliteration":"ammihud","gloss":"Ammihud"}],"senses":[{"id":"H3936H","gloss":"Ladan","relation":"H3936H = a Name of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}